      "description_zh": "专有宿主机ID。",
      "example": "dh-bp165p6xk2tlw61e****",
      "help_en": "The ID of the dedicated host",
      "help_zh": "专有宿主机ID",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "dedicated_host_id",
      "options": [
        "--dedicated-host-id"
      ],
      "raw_name": "DedicatedHostId",
      "required": true,
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "description_en": "Specifies whether to stop the instance before it is migrated to the destination dedicated host. Valid values:\n\n- reboot: stops the instance before migration.\n\n- LiveMigrationFirst: migrates the instance without stopping it. If you set MigrationType to LiveMigrationFirst, you must specify DedicatedHostId. In this case, you cannot change the instance type of the ECS instance when the instance is migrated. If the migration in LiveMigrationFirst mode fails, the system switches to the Reboot mode.\n\nDefault value: reboot.",
      "description_zh": "是否先停止实例，再迁移到目标专有宿主机。取值范围：\n\n- Reboot：先停止实例再迁移。\n\n- LiveMigrationFirst：不停止实例，直接迁移。此时，您必须指定参数DedicatedHostId。该取值不支持在迁移ECS实例的同时变更实例规格。如果在线迁移失败会默认走关机迁移。\n\n默认值：Reboot。",
      "example": "Reboot",
      "help_en": "Specifies whether to stop the instance before it is migrated to the destination dedicated host. Valid values:\n\n- reboot: stops the instance before migration.\n\n- LiveMigrationFirst: migrates the instance without stopping it. If you set MigrationType to LiveMigrationFirst, you must specify DedicatedHostId. In this case, you cannot change the instance type of the ECS instance when the instance is migrated. If the migration in LiveMigrationFirst mode fails, the system switches to the Reboot mode.\n\nDefault value: reboot",
      "help_zh": "是否先停止实例，再迁移到目标专有宿主机。取值范围：\n\n- Reboot：先停止实例再迁移。\n\n- LiveMigrationFirst：不停止实例，直接迁移。此时，您必须指定参数DedicatedHostId。该取值不支持在迁移ECS实例的同时变更实例规格。如果在线迁移失败会默认走关机迁移。\n\n默认值：Reboot",
      "location": "query",
      "name": "migration_type",
      "options": [
        "--migration-type"
      ],
      "raw_name": "MigrationType",
      "required": false,
      "type": "string"
    }
